  "prefLabel": "Ed 320.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 320.01 Applicability. In order for a public school, public academy, chartered public school, or nonpublic school to operate a facility to be used for K-12 educational purposes, it shall request approval to operate prior to student occupancy to ensure a clean, healthy, and safe facility.\n\nSource. ##13772, eff 10-12-23",
